## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
Issue #90 removes the misleading Hello World document shown on first launch.

### Decisions Made
- Represent a fresh project as no tabs and an empty editor, rather than an unsaved synthetic document.
- Keep Open as a folder picker and do not auto-open README after selection.
- Keep New File folder-first and retain the selected folder if filename entry is cancelled.

### Trade-offs
- Saving from the empty state now explicitly creates and opens a real workspace file, preserving the former default-tab save workflow without showing a starter source.
